--- a NULL and an empty string are not the same value
Nullable(String)	1	\N
Nullable(String)	0	
Nullable(String)	0	68656C6C6F
--- without the setting the sentinel is an ordinary value
String	01
String	
String	68656C6C6F
--- the sentinel avoids the data of the column
1	\N
0	01
--- a FixedString of one byte whose data takes the shortest sentinel
1	\N
0	01
--- a String column with no NULLs is written without the attribute
String	hello
String	hello
